# tier-2 additions, untracked 2026-07-17 (same repo-diet criterion): each is
# rewritten by the DAILY chain before the nightly rsync, so the box pull that
# deletes the newly-untracked copy self-heals the same night.
#   leaderboard_gamelogs.json  d5e (every daily + chained monthly night)
#   prospx_leaderboard.json    d9d (every daily + chained monthly night)
#   mlb_projections.json       d9b proj_export re-bake
#   player_links.json          d9b2 mlb_player_export.export -> _export_links
#   mlb_position_games.json    d9b2 mlb_player_export.export -> _export_position_games
#   mlb_trade_players.json     d9 rebuild_only -> storage.export_timeseries_json
#   overseas_timeseries.json   d9 rebuild_only -> export_overseas_json
# NOT untracked (monthly-only producers; a daily pull would leave them absent
# for up to a month): bullpen/starter/hitter/leverage leaderboards (6b4*),
# pal.json (6b5), swing_plus.json (6b2), stuff_plus_aaa.json (6b2b),
# star_label_view.json (test_star_odds.py hard-reads it in the publish gate).
data/leaderboard_gamelogs.json
data/prospx_leaderboard.json
