# --- Accounts / Supabase ------------------------------------------------
# assets/eephus-config.js is now a COMMITTED-BLANK stub (kills the per-page
# 404 console error the missing file used to log; blank values keep the
# account layer dormant). Real values are filled at deploy time — keep them
# out of source control. Service-role keys NEVER live in the repo.
.env
.env.local

# --- Committed brand artifacts ------------------------------------------
# The repo-root .gitignore ignores *.png globally, but these are generated
# ONCE by tools/generate_brand_assets.py and must ship in source control:
# every page references the apple-touch icon and the Open Graph share card,
# and the nightly build must serve byte-identical icons without regenerating.
# (favicon.ico / favicon.svg aren't *.png, so they need no exception.)
!assets/favicon-32.png
!assets/favicon-16.png
!assets/apple-touch-icon.png
!assets/share-default.png
# article hero/inline images are authored content, not build output -
# without this carve-out a NEW article's image is silently ignored and
# 404s in production while working locally
!assets/articles/
!assets/articles/**/*.png
!assets/icon-192.png
!assets/icon-512.png
!assets/icon-maskable-512.png
# The pixel favicon and app-icon set (tools/pixel_brand.py, BR-04), served
# behind build_site.py's PIXEL_BRAND flag.
!assets/brand/*.png
# The pixel share cards, one per module (tools/pixel_brand.py, BR-07), served
# behind the same flag.
!assets/og/*.png
# Per-player Open Graph cards (Pass C) live under assets/share/.
!assets/share/
!assets/share/*.png
# Branding bundle: the documented export folder (marks, icons, social cards,
# manifest, brand guide). Its PNGs are copies of the committed assets above.
!branding/icons/*.png
!branding/social/*.png
!branding/animated/*.png
!branding/animated/*.gif
!branding/animated/frames/
!branding/animated/frames/*.png

